  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1 ABF VH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 ABF V&#xe4;stra H&#xe4;lsingland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r ett samarbete mellan ABF Sverige och en organisation som befinner sig i exil. Projektet f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas inneb&#xe4;ra &#xf6;kad stabilitet, samordning och framtidstro f&#xf6;r organisationen. Den f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas ocks&#xe5; skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande verksamhet till hemlandet n&#xe4;r det &#xe4;r m&#xf6;jligt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a collaboration between ABF Sweden and an organisation in exile. The project is expected to bring increased stability, coordination and optimism for the future of the organisation. It is also expected to create conditions for a return to operations in the home country when possible.</narrative>
  </description>
